{"speciesId":450,"names":{"fr":"Hippodocus","es":"Hippowdon","en":"Hippowdon","ja":"カバルドン"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"It blasts internally stored sand from ports on its body to create a towering twister for attack."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"Its huge mouth is almost seven feet across. It has enough power to completely crush a car."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"It is surprisingly quick to anger. It holds its mouth agape as a display of its strength."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"It brandishes its gaping mouth in a display of fearsome strength. It raises vast quantities of sand while attacking."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"It brandishes its gaping mouth in a display of fearsome strength. It raises vast quantities of sand while attacking."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Facilement irritable, il ouvre ses mâchoires au maximum pour intimider ses adversaires."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"It is surprisingly quick to anger. It holds its mouth agape as a display of its strength."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Facilement irritable, il ouvre ses mâchoires au maximum pour intimider ses adversaires."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"It is surprisingly quick to anger. It holds its mouth agape as a display of its strength."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"It is surprisingly quick to anger. It holds its mouth agape as a display of its strength."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"It is surprisingly quick to anger. It holds its mouth agape as a display of its strength."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Il exhibe sa force en ouvrant grand sa mâchoire, et attaque en soulevant des tornades de sable."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Hace gala de su fuerza abriendo su enorme boca. Para atacar levanta gran cantidad de arena."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"It brandishes its gaping mouth in a display of fearsome strength. It raises vast quantities of sand while attacking."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"大きく 口を 開けて 自分の 強さを アピール。 大量の 砂を 巻き上げて 攻撃する。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Il emmagasine du sable qu’il expulse en tornades par les pores de sa peau pour attaquer."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Cuando ataca, expulsa arena almacenada en su interior para crear un gran tornado."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"It blasts internally stored sand from ports on its body to create a towering twister for attack."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"体内に ためた 砂を 体の 穴から 噴き上げて 巨大な 竜巻を 作り 攻撃する。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Il exhibe sa force en ouvrant grand sa mâchoire, et attaque en soulevant des tornades de sable."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Hace gala de su fuerza abriendo su enorme boca. Para atacar levanta gran cantidad de arena."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"It brandishes its gaping mouth in a display of fearsome strength. It raises vast quantities of sand while attacking."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"大きく 口を 開けて 自分の 強さを アピール。 大量の 砂を 巻き上げて 攻撃する。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Il emmagasine du sable qu’il expulse en tornades par les pores de sa peau pour attaquer."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Cuando ataca, expulsa arena almacenada en su interior para crear un gran tornado."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"It blasts internally stored sand from ports on its body to create a towering twister for attack."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"体内に ためた 砂を 体の 穴から 噴き上げて 巨大な 竜巻を 作り 攻撃する。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Il prend grand soin des Crabicoque, car ils l’aident à se débarrasser des cailloux qui obstruent parfois les orifices de son corps."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Protege con celo a los Dwebble, ya que le ayudan a 